<title>USA: Inland Resources revises '96 income data.</title>
<headline>Inland Resources revises '96 income data.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inland Resources Inc said on Friday that it revised three and nine month net income and per share amounts, for the periods ending September 30, 1996, due to an accounting change.</p>
<p>Because the company said it changed its accounting for deferred income taxes associated with a recent acquisition, it said it adjusted net income to $726,018, or $0.12 per share, for the three month period ended September 30, from previously announced earnings of $0.07 per share.</p>
</text>
